<title>POLAND: Mostostal Krakow surge surprises traders.</title>
<headline>Mostostal Krakow surge surprises traders.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Mostostal Krakow SA surged 10 percent to 23.1 zlotys in moderate trade but analysts said they could not explain the scale of the surge.</p>
<p>&quot;I can't think of any explanation for the surge other than the generally good prospects of the construction sector as a whole,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Traders also said the low liquidity of the stock made it prone to speculative moves.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
